# The CodeQL T2b treatment is reproduced from committed artefacts only:
#   - capquery/            the good-faith reachability query + qlpack
#   - codeql_facts.csv     the consolidated 25-pair fact table
#   - build_facts.py       the generator
#   - score_poc.py         the PoC scorer
#   - REPRODUCE.md         how to regenerate
# Everything below is a heavy, machine-local build artefact and is NOT
# committed: the study harness and its tests read codeql_facts.csv and
# never need any of these.

# CodeQL CLI (~1.3GB, pinned to 2.25.6 in REPRODUCE.md).
codeql/

# Per-pair CodeQL databases and the staged extraction sources, both
# regenerated by build_facts.py.
db_*/
src_*/

# Query-run scratch output.
*.bqrs
